而弃西夏千千万万的子民于不顾吗？”西夏王气得浑身发抖。“我……”夏寒轩一时语塞。媚儿乘机禀奏：“大王，请您下旨吧，不要让媚儿成为全西夏的罪人！”西夏王也配合媚儿地点了点头：“还是媚儿通情达理！好！孤王马上就下旨！小高，你马上去通知商国使者，告诉他，不出五日，我西夏圣女便会前往商国和亲！”“遵大王旨意！”高公公匆匆地领命出宫。“父王！不要！”夏寒轩依旧跪在地上求着，可西夏王却无动于衷，在看着龙印盖下去的那一刻，他感觉自己的心也跟着一起沉了下去。西夏王狠狠瞪了自己儿子一眼，沉声道：“孤本来打算借这次身体微恙而退位给你，看来，你还不够成熟，这么意气用事，我们祖先辛辛苦苦打下的江山，还有西夏万千的子民，若是这样交到你的手上，叫孤如何放心？”说完，冲夏寒轩身边的奴才喝道：“把世子带回寝宫面壁思过半个月！”他的意思再明显不过，在媚儿出嫁之前，他可不想自己的傻儿子再出来弄事。“父王，您不能这么残忍，您不能不能把媚儿嫁走，父王，儿臣求您了……”夏寒轩也算是个痴情的男人，一心只想劝西夏王改变主意。只是西夏王心意已决，又岂是他所能阻止得了？“还不把世下殿下拉下去！”西夏王的话里透着绝对的威严，硬生生地将夏寒轩想要说的话给逼了回去。“世子殿下……”一旁的奴才也是满脸苦恼，圣命难违，可是，主子也不能得罪！“父王，您太狠心了！您也有心爱的女人，难道您不知道失去心爱的女人那种痛苦吗？您忍心看您的儿子重蹈覆辙吗？”“放肆！”西夏王气得两眼圆争，大手重重地拍在桌子上，只差没头上冒烟了，指着夏寒轩怒道：“你这个逆子！”“大王息怒！”一旁的奴才们都跟着跪了下去。媚儿偷眼望着西夏王，暗道，这就是古代的帝王，一发飙，全都跪了一地！“世子殿下……”一旁的奴才身抖齿颤，可怜兮兮的望着主子。夏寒轩无奈暗暗咬了咬牙，满脸不甘地冲出了殿外。“真是个逆子！”夏寒轩走后，西夏王还是怒气不减，摒退所有人之后，对媚儿道：“你的目的马上就要达到了，你答应过孤王的事情，也希望你不要忘记！”媚儿妩媚一笑：“大王放心，我媚儿既然答应过您的事，就一定会帮您办到，不过，我并不认识他，我要如何与他联络？”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/dizhenhuanzhizuidufeifei/10.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The first hatred of genocide: \"Father, you have always known that my son likes Meier, and we in Xixia have always had rules. Saint girls can only marry the future king. Meier should marry me. Please don't marry her to the Shang Kingdom!\" Xia Hanxuan, who woke up, quickly knelt down and begged the king of Xixia. \"You traitor! Now it's not the solitary king who has the final say with you. Shang Litian wants her by name. If she doesn't go, the Shang Kingdom will raise its troops to invade within five days. At that time, the entire people of Xixia will face the situation of family destruction and death. Are you abandoning thousands of people of Xixia for your own selfishness?\" The king of Xixia was shaking with anger. \"I...\" Xia Hanxuan was speechless for a moment. Mei'er took the opportunity to report: \"Your Majesty, please issue an edict. Don't let Mei'er become the sinner of all Xixia!\" The King of Xixia also nodded in agreement with Mei'er: \"Mei'er is reasonable! Okay! King Gu will issue the edict immediately! Xiao Gao, please go and inform the envoy of Shang State immediately and tell him that within five days, I, the Saint of Xixia, will go to Shang State to get married!\" \"According to the king's order!\" Eunuch Gao hurriedly took the order and left the palace. \"Father! No!\" Xia Hanxuan still knelt on the ground and begged, but the King of Xixia was indifferent. The moment he watched the dragon seal go down, he felt his heart sinking along with it. The King of Xixia glared at his son fiercely and said in a deep voice: \"I originally planned to take advantage of this slight illness to abdicate the throne to you. It seems that you are not mature enough. You are so motivated. The country that our ancestors worked so hard to build, and the thousands of people in Xixia, if this How can I rest assured if I leave this in your hands?\" After saying that, he shouted to the servant next to Xia Hanxuan: \"Take the prince back to the palace to think about it for half a month!\" His meaning was obvious. Before Meier got married, he didn't want his stupid son to come out and cause trouble again. \"Father, you can't be so cruel. You can't marry Meier away. Father, I beg you...\" Xia Hanxuan was also an infatuated man, and he only wanted to persuade the King of Xixia to change his mind. It's just that the King of Xixia has made up his mind, so how can he stop it? \"Don't drag His Highness down yet!\" King Xixia's words were filled with absolute majesty, forcefully forcing back what Xia Hanxuan wanted to say. \"His Royal Highness...\" The servants on the side also looked distressed. It was difficult to violate the holy order, but the master could not be offended either! \"Father, you are so cruel! You also have a beloved woman. Don't you know the pain of losing a beloved woman? Can you bear to see your son make the same mistake again?\" \"How outrageous!\" The King of Xixia was so angry that his eyes widened. He slammed his big hand on the table so hard that his head was covered with smoke. He pointed at Xia Hanxuan and said angrily: \"You traitor!\" \"Your Majesty, calm down!\" All the servants on the side knelt down. Meier secretly looked at the King of Xixia and thought to herself, this is the ancient emperor. When he got angry, they all knelt on the ground! \"His Royal Highness...\" The servant on the side was trembling and looking at his master pitifully. Xia Hanxuan gritted his teeth helplessly and rushed out of the hall with a look of reluctance. \"What a traitor!\" After Xia Hanxuan left, the King of Xixia was still angry. After shooing everyone away, he said to Meier: \"Your goal is about to be achieved. You promised the lonely king, and I hope you won't forget it!\" Meier smiled charmingly: \"Don't worry, your Majesty, since I, Meier, have promised you, I will definitely help you do it. However, I don't know him, how can I contact him?\"", "title_en": "Chapter 10"}